00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.079
Examine the fictional draft and mark keep, remove, verify or rewrite with reasons.

00:00:06.079 --> 00:00:09.352
Keep the useful explanation and visible exclusions.

00:00:09.352 --> 00:00:11.223
Rewrite the incorrect subtotal.

00:00:11.223 --> 00:00:18.237
Three times forty equals one hundred twenty; add twenty to obtain one hundred forty dollars.

00:00:18.237 --> 00:00:21.510
Compare each repeated number with that calculation.

00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:28.524
Remove the claim that the guide guarantees customer acceptance because no supporting evidence is supplied.

00:00:28.524 --> 00:00:32.265
Record material claims, source limits, permissions and attribution.

00:00:32.265 --> 00:00:37.409
A second AI agreeing with the first is not independent verification.

00:00:37.409 --> 00:00:43.488
If a necessary external fact or reuse permission remains unresolved, hold that content.

00:00:43.488 --> 00:00:50.502
The corrected training subtotal is still not a recommended price or an approved customer quote.

00:00:50.502 --> 00:00:56.581
Save the original wording, the correction and the evidence that supports the change.
